node_modules
# A bare pattern matches the context root only, so scripts/node_modules would
# otherwise ride along and overwrite what `npm ci` installed in the image —
# with macOS binaries, on a linux/amd64 image. Every Dockerfile here installs
# its own dependencies, so nothing needs a host node_modules copied in.
**/node_modules
dist
.git
.github
.windsurf
.agent
.agents
.claude
.factory
.planning
e2e
src-tauri/target
src-tauri/sidecar/node
*.log
# Local self-hosting credentials must not enter Docker build contexts or caches.
docker-compose.override.yml
secrets/
*.md
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
docs/internal
docs/Docs_To_Review
tests
